<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Hello, <o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Pursuant to Section 2.3 of the Agreement, we are requesting
a reconciliation <span style="line-height: 107%;">to determine
whether we have received an amount greater or less than the Purchased
Percentage of your Future Receivables. </span>&nbsp;In order to process your request please
provide us with the last two months of bank statements.&nbsp; We need to receive those within the next <b>five
(5) days</b> for us to process the reconciliation.&nbsp; Once we receive the statements, we will
process your request and notify you of any adjustment to the remittance amount
going forward.&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p>

<span style="line-height: 107%;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please note, if we do not receive the bank
statements within such time, the remittance amount will return to the Initial
Remittance amount provided for in page one of the Agreement.</font></span><div style=""><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thank you,&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="arial">{!User.Name} |&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Title}</span></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></p></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</font></div></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="arial">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone} | F:&nbsp;{!User.Fax}</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span style="font-family: arial;">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</span></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
